  "body": "The `allowpaymentrequest` attribute is used by the Payment Request API to determine if Document objects in an `iframe` element's browsing context are to be allowed to make payment requests.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/w3c/browser-payment-api/issues/311\r\nSee also https://github.com/w3c/browser-payment-api/pull/359",
